                {
                    "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
                    "markdown": "- Added SOOP++ settings at the top of the app's Settings, with an option for each feature and an update check\n- Added Ghost Mode: join chat as a guest so you don't appear in the viewer list (all streams or selected streamers)\n- Added a playback buffer badge and Live Catch-up: tap to jump back toward live, with optional automatic catch-up and a one-time catch-up on entry\n- Added a preferred entry quality for streams\n- Added an option to hide the AdBalloon banner when you join a stream\n- Ghost Mode and catch-up notices now appear inside the player right away\n- Buffer and Ghost Mode badges now work in Multiview\n- Refreshed the startup card",
                    "useSpacing": true
